      "point": "ln = floor(t*9*0.9999)\nu = t*9 - ln\nu = if(equal(mod(ln, 2), 0), u, 1 - u)\noff = 0.03*min(air_att, 2)*sin(u*18 + p5 + ln*1.7) + v*0.015\nx = (u*2 - 1)*aspect*1.06\ny = ((ln + 0.5)/9*2 - 1)*0.92 + off"
    },
    {
      "type": "particles",
